1
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:04,180
Anak, buksan mo.

2
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:05,300
Pa?

3
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:14,050
Pa…?? sino ’yung nasa pinto ko?

4
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,000
Huwag mong buksan.

5
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:23,100
Huwag mong buksan.

6
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:32,600
Sa bubong. May gumagalaw.

7
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:36,100
Pa, may pumapasok!

8
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:40,150
Anak. Papasukin mo ako.

9
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:56,200
Anak, nasa hagdan na ako.

10
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:03,550
May gumaya sa boses mo.

11
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:04,700
Narinig ko.

12
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:11,000
Kung yero lang ’yung sugat mo, bakit takot ka rito?

13
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:13,450
Hindi kita gustong madamay.

14
00:01:13,700 --> 00:01:21,500
May gumaya sa boses ni Papa. Nasa labas siya, pero naririnig ko sa pinto.

15
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:23,900
Na-record mo?

16
00:01:23,900 --> 00:01:25,600
Pakinggan mo.

17
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:28,450
Anak. Papasukin mo ako.

18
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:31,200
Mata lang. Huwag kamay.

19
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,350
Nag-aalala ka sa ’kin?

20
00:01:34,060 --> 00:01:35,200
Sa paninda ko.

21
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:38,600
Sandali. Lakasan mo.

22
00:01:43,140 --> 00:01:44,250
Kampana?

23
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:48,400
Sa lumang palaisdaan. Doon ’yung basag na kampana.

24
00:01:48,980 --> 00:01:50,650
Doon daw nasugatan si Papa.

25
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:54,800
Alam mo pala kung saan kami pupunta.

26
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:58,750
May alam ka rin. Bakit ayaw mong sabihin?

27
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:00,450
Sasama ako.

28
00:02:02,780 --> 00:02:06,500
Kapag may tumawag sa ’yo, tingnan mo muna kung sino.

29
00:02:07,940 --> 00:02:09,850
Dito niya nililinis ’yung sugat.

30
00:02:16,347 --> 00:02:20,607
Bagwis… sabihin mo kung bakit siya umuwi.

31
00:02:22,667 --> 00:02:24,927
Anong ibig niyang sabihin?
